//   Row 1  Cards: Total Users · Total Monthly Revenue · Avg Revenue per User
//                 · Lifetime Revenue · Average Age
//   Row 2  Clustered bar   : Total Monthly Revenue by Country[Country] (sorted desc)
//          Donut           : Total Users by Subscription[Subscription Type]
//   Row 3  Column chart    : Total Monthly Revenue by Device[Device]
//          Table           : Subscription Type | Total Users | Total Monthly Revenue
//                            | Revenue Share %
//   Slicers (left pane)    : Country, Gender, Subscription Type
//
//  PAGE 2 — "User Insights"
//   Row 1  Cards: Female Users · Male Users · Avg Tenure (Months) · Premium Users
//   Row 2  Line chart      : Total Users by 'Date'[Year-Month]  (joins over time)
//          Stacked column  : Total Users by Age Group, legend = Subscription Type
//   Row 3  Matrix          : Rows Country, Columns Subscription Type,
//                            Values Total Monthly Revenue (conditional formatting)
//          Pie             : Total Users by Gender[Gender]
//   Slicers                : Device, Age Group
//
